====== ALLNET ALL0256N ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The ALL0256N is 2.4GHz 802.11n 1T1R outdoor access-point/bridge system based on the Ralink Rt3050.
Support for the board used in the device was added to OpenWrt and the device comes with OpenWrt 12.09 preinstalled.

