===== Specific Configuration =====
==== Interfaces ====

The default network configuration is:
^ Interface Name   ^ Description   ^ Default configuration   ^
| br-lan           | LAN & WiFi    | 192.168.1.1/24          |

==== Switch Ports (for VLANs) ====
The device got only one Ethernet port. The built-in embedded switch can be used to perform hardware VLAN.

==== Failsafe mode ====
-> [[docs:guide-user:troubleshooting:failsafe_and_factory_reset]]

==== Buttons ====
-> [[docs:guide-user:hardware:hardware.button]] on howto use and configure the hardware button(s).

The ALL0256N got a Reset button. Hold it for more than 10 seconds to restore the factory defaults or use it to trigger Failsafe mode.

